    "sr-b05-u28-01": ["aquarium", 0, "C1", 13, "/əˈkwɛəriəm/", "An aquarium is a building where fish and underwater animals are kept.", "bể cá", "We took a trip to the aquarium and saw a scary shark.", "aquarium", []],
