    "sr-b05-u29-08": ["excerpt", 0, "C1", 13, "/ˈeksərpt/", "An excerpt is a short piece of writing or music taken from a larger piece.", "đoạn trích", "I didn’t listen to the entire symphony online, but I did play an excerpt.", "excerpt", ["play an excerpt"]],
