    "sr-b06-u11-08": ["enroll", 1, "B1", 8, "/enˈroʊl/", "To enroll in something is to put one’s name on a list as a member of a group.", "ghi danh", "The students had to enroll in the class one semester in advance.", "enroll", ["enroll in the class"]],
