    "sr-b06-u11-15": ["morale", 0, "B2", 14, "/moʊˈræl/", "Morale is the amount of hope that people have during a difficult situation.", "tinh thần", "To improve our family’s morale, mom suggested going on a picnic.", "morale", []],
