    "sr-b06-u13-05": ["curb", 1, "B2", 14, "/kɜːrb/", "To curb something means to prevent it from happening or increasing.", "kiềm chế, hạn chế", "She curbed her anger by listening to a relaxing song.", "curbed", ["curb anger - kiềm chế cơn giận", "curb inflation - kiềm chế lạm phát"]],
