    "sr-b06-u25-11": ["mimic", 1, "C1", 14, "/ˈmimik/", "To mimic something means to copy the way it sounds or moves.", "bắt chước", "The hunter mimicked a duck’s call and shot the two ducks that called back.", "mimicked", []],
