    "sr-b06-u25-16": ["staple", 2, "B2", 14, "/ˈsteɪpəl/", "If something is staple, it is standard or basic.", "cơ bản, chủ yếu", "Hamburgers, steaks and hotdogs are staple foods to cook on a grill.", "staple", ["staple foods"]],
