    "sr-b06-u27-16": ["seasoning", 0, "B1", 8, "/ˈsiːzəniŋ/", "Seasoning is a mix of salt, herbs, and spices that improves the taste of food.", "gia vị", "This steak tastes bland. Maybe I’ll add some seasoning to it.", "seasoning", ["add seasoning"]],
